# mcnux.th — the pinned MCNuX test ThornList (specs/build-and-integration.md
# [MCNX-BLD-04], verbatim).
#
# This is a COMPILE list over an existing Cactus checkout (the
# WeakLibInterp/cactus/wli.th precedent), not a GetComponents fetch list:
# Compile-ETK copies it into configs/mcnux/ThornList. The flesh is the
# checkout; every line below must resolve under $CACTUSX/arrangements/
# (agent_scripts/sandbox/setup.sh creates the MCNuX and WeakLibInterp
# arrangement symlinks).
#
# Membership is binding — removals are out of contract; production
# configurations may extend it (see the spec's membership rationale).

